      "text": "[5:55p.m.] #AgegeMotorRoad #TrafficUpdate \n\nThe stretch of the Agege Motor road is in good shape, though a bit slow at Oshodi underneath the bridge to brown intersection, then better all the way through Bolade, Ladipo, Shogunle, PWD, Airport bus stop, National, Ikeja overpass to Ajayi farm and on to IleZik.\n\nOur Men are strategically positioned to ensure traffic is good.\n\n @Sola_Giwa @gm_lastma @followlasg @GoldmyneTV @Mr_JAGs @gbenga_omo @TrafficChiefNG @channelstv @lagosMOT1 @lagostraffic961 @daily_trust @thecableng @walemusa @seunosiyemi_ @vanguardngrnews @MobilePunch @NigeriaNewsdesk @TheNationNews @GuardianNigeria @FRSCNigeria @Gidi_Traffic",
